REPOSITORY-PATTERN.
    MOVE 1 TO VALUE-ITEM(1) MOVE 2 TO VALUE-ITEM(2)
    MOVE 10 TO SEEN-ITEM(1) MOVE 20 TO SEEN-ITEM(2)
    MOVE 0 TO BALANCE
    PERFORM VARYING INDEX-N FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL INDEX-N > 2
        IF VALUE-ITEM(INDEX-N) = 2 MOVE SEEN-ITEM(INDEX-N) TO BALANCE END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    IF BALANCE = 20 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
